<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA LEAD CROATIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA LEAD CROATIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SPLIT, Croatia 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia took a 2-0 lead</p>
<p>over Croatia in their Davis Cup World group qualifying tie after</p>
<p>winning both singles matches on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis beat Sasa Hirszon 6-2 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Jason Stoltenberg beat Goran Ivanisevic 3-6 6-3 3-6 7-6 6-2</p>
</text>
